id=abxytweaks
name=abxylute One tweaks (adb root, fixed adb port, vendor OTA off)
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=karl0ss
description=Grants adb shell root once (Magisk root_access=Apps and ADB), wireless adb on fixed port 5555, disables the vendor settings app's OTA service, telemetry receiver and feature provider, hides the persistent vendor keyguard app (unused with the phone SystemUI module). Log: /data/local/tmp/abxytweaks.log
